  "contentHtml": "\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Warm up with a comforting bowl of broth, noodles, and fresh vegetables that’s easy to make at home. Asian noodle soup features a savory base flavored with ginger, garlic, and soy, filled with rice noodles, carrots, bok choy, and scallions. Light yet satisfying, this healthy recipe is vegetarian-friendly and can be customized with chicken, shrimp, or tofu. Asian noodle soup is perfect for quick weeknight dinners or cozy weekends when you crave flavor-packed comfort.</p>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-rank-math-toc-block\" id=\"rank-math-toc\"><h2>Table of Contents</h2><nav><ul><li><a href=\"#why-youll-love-this-asian-noodle-soup\">Why You’ll Love This asian noodle soup</a></li><li><a href=\"#ingredients\">Ingredients</a></li><li><a href=\"#how-to-make-amazing-asian-noodle-soup\">How to Make Amazing Asian Noodle Soup</a></li><li><a href=\"#recipe-snapshot\">Recipe Snapshot</a></li><li><a href=\"#pro-tips-for-making-asian-noodle-soup\">Pro Tips for Making Asian Noodle Soup</a></li><li><a href=\"#how-to-serve-this-asian-noodle-soup\">How to Serve this asian noodle soup</a></li><li><a href=\"#make-ahead-and-storage\">Make Ahead and Storage</a></li><li><a href=\"#fa-qs\">FAQs</a></li><li><a href=\"#final-thoughts\">Final Thoughts</a></li></ul></nav></div>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"why-youll-love-this-asian-noodle-soup\"><strong>Why You’ll Love This asian noodle soup</strong></h2>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Warm and comforting, perfect for any day.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Customizable with your favorite veggies and proteins.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Quick to prepare, making weeknight dinners a breeze.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Packed with flavor, thanks to aromatic spices and herbs.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Healthy and nourishing, great for your body and soul.</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n<div id=\"wprm-recipe-container-3360\" class=\"wprm-recipe-container\" data-recipe-id=\"3360\" data-servings=\"4\"><div class=\"wprm-recipe wprm-recipe-te